## 5️⃣ Testing

| Layer | Tool | Sample |
|-------|------|--------|
| **Unit** | Jest + React Testing Library | Test component rendering |
| **Integration** | Cypress | End‑to‑end checkout flow |
| **Visual** | Chromatic | Storybook snapshots |
| **Accessibility** | axe-core | Run `npm run test:accessibility` |

```bash
npm install --save-dev jest @testing-library/react @testing-library/jest-dom cypress axe-core
```

Example unit test:

```tsx
